=== util-linux ===
mount from util-linux 2.41.5 (libmount 2.41.5: selinux, smack, btrfs, verity, namespaces, idmapping, fd-based-mount, statmount, statx, assert, debug)
=== namespace form ===
unshare --mount --

===== plain / tgt / dir / '' (expect FOLLOWED_VULNERABLE) =====
  plain bind, dir-symlink target, exact
mount_rc=0
mount_stderr=
VERDICT=FOLLOWED_VULNERABLE
ok   plain/tgt/dir/'': FOLLOWED_VULNERABLE

